cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper and the dataset record.
title: hui-emg-imu-gesture
abstract: >-
  A cross-user one-shot enrolment benchmark for gesture recognition from a nine-electrode forearm
  EMG ring and an upper-arm inertial sensor, with eleven subjects, five sessions and sixteen
  gestures spanning finger-counting postures and arm commands.
